I press the 'Submit' button.
Then the website shows a message.
"A password is sent to your mobile number."
The screen shows a sixty-second timer.
The time slowly decreases.
Finally, it reaches zero.
But the message does not come to my phone.
Usually, such messages come quickly.
I sigh.
I walk to the window to stretch my legs.
Then I look at the other instructions on the phone.
There is another way to get the code in it.
I follow those instructions on the screen.
I choose a new option.
Then it shows like this on the website.
"The code is sent to the registered email address instead."
